# ============================================================
# MapWrapper_Flow.graph
# Unity Visual Scripting  –  FlowGraph Node Specification
#
# ARCHITECTURE CONTRACT:
#   Camera position math, Cinemachine.OnTargetObjectWarped,
#   and GameObject.Find lookups stay in C#.
#   VS reads MapWidth and MapHeight for HUD/minimap scaling.
#
# NODE MAP:
#   [Start] → [GetComponent<MapWrapper>]
#     → [GetMember: MapWidth]  → wire to minimap scale X
#     → [GetMember: MapHeight] → wire to minimap scale Y
#
# CUSTOM EVENTS:
#   (none — this graph is purely data-provision for HUD systems)
#
# MACHINE SETUP:
#   ScriptMachine on the MapWrapper GameObject in the scene
# ============================================================